SDK patch 0307 (Max Payne 3 port): each color target is bound at its own slot. A pass that leaves a slot out
(c0, c2, c3 with c1's mask 0: Max Payne 3's decals) packed the others together, so c3 got the pixel shader's oC2 and
c2 its oC1: green light on floors and wrong normals. The gap gets another bound target's view with a write mask of 0
(deko3d reads every slot it is given).

